{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i><u>Note: This Game is Regularly Updated Based on Player Feedback</u></i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hunt the Six &quot;Super Artifacts&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Historic Helix is a top-down action-adventure built around exploration, instant progression, and route choice. Expand a treasure map overworld, enter new levels, collect artifacts that upgrade you on pickup, and track down six major relics that change how you move, fight, and explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/7fb7e6781d3a5ef1f75958aa33f9cf57.poster.avif?t=1772999292\" width=1074 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/7fb7e6781d3a5ef1f75958aa33f9cf57.webm?t=1772999292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Growing Treasure Map</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fragment reveals more of the world. Open new pins, uncover shortcuts, and choose where to go next across deserts, deep seas, icy paths, jungles, and stranger places beyond them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/9d9ff9307e9de8445521b00fc0de18b3.poster.avif?t=1772999292\" width=1074 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/9d9ff9307e9de8445521b00fc0de18b3.webm?t=1772999292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade by Playing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no upgrade menus slowing you down. Pick up artifacts and map fragments to improve your character immediately, so every discovery matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/961d2c602e586791751085f49a86621e.poster.avif?t=1772999292\" width=1074 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/961d2c602e586791751085f49a86621e.webm?t=1772999292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Route</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the path that looks safest, hardest, richest, or weirdest. Different route orders change the pace of progression and the challenges you face on the way to each Super Artifact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/3c10dcb5a7e9dbdb18f44105b79b783a.poster.avif?t=1772999292\" width=1074 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/3c10dcb5a7e9dbdb18f44105b79b783a.webm?t=1772999292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lore in the Details</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artifacts unlock stories, memories, and clues tied to the places you explore. Dig deep into the mystery, or stay focused on the hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/0a882e68a9f8ff5128715b102375f11b.poster.avif?t=1772999292\" width=1074 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/0a882e68a9f8ff5128715b102375f11b.webm?t=1772999292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Top-Down Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burst through hazards with Surge, hold your ground with Rage, and master enemies, chambers, shortcuts, and boss encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/4d7d60b42eb5308775f52ee3175e744e.poster.avif?t=1772999292\" width=1074 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/4d7d60b42eb5308775f52ee3175e744e.webm?t=1772999292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/e68dcb8eb44d5f99114d89c1b2e7b955.poster.avif?t=1772999292\" width=1074 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/e68dcb8eb44d5f99114d89c1b2e7b955.webm?t=1772999292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Soundtrack That Grows With You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music &amp; Sound Effects shifts with movement, progress, and momentum to make each area and collectable feel more alive as you explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/f4041714369d8f75693cdc57532c0581.poster.avif?t=1772999292\" width=1074 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/f4041714369d8f75693cdc57532c0581.webm?t=1772999292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built for Explorers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Historic Helix is made for players who love hidden routes, collectible hunting, nonlinear progression, and uncovering secrets piece by piece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/a9051ddc7e2dd23d7b295fa88f2b3a42.poster.avif?t=1772999292\" width=1074 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/a9051ddc7e2dd23d7b295fa88f2b3a42.webm?t=1772999292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/efaf649658e9251b48bbdc653509f492.poster.avif?t=1772999292\" width=1074 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/efaf649658e9251b48bbdc653509f492.webm?t=1772999292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/c38f284bb5ef282b19c130d70ab4a7af.poster.avif?t=1772999292\" width=1074 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/c38f284bb5ef282b19c130d70ab4a7af.webm?t=1772999292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Optional Chat-Plays for Streamers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streamers can enable viewer-driven challenge commands through Streamer.bot. This feature is optional and not required for normal play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/3ebfc7cdcb61e68e6560c699eca7e13e.poster.avif?t=1772999292\" width=1074 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844910/extras/3ebfc7cdcb61e68e6560c699eca7e13e.webm?t=1772999292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Out of the Nest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844910/1f14d4e9de35538d81b8ac025c273711afeb8c3c.jpg"},{"name":"Spark in the Glass","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844910/0410daa22d25adf80d6641390e8e2a4dc19d4fbd.jpg"},{"name":"Pharaoh\u2019s Whisper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844910/fdc3397ff2fe230497ef4b43062bd5145e2d4fed.jpg"},{"name":"Sand Script","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844910/18c7641af8765f8a97b9cbab580c05ec4e798954.jpg"},{"name":"Glacial Humor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844910/c0df5615f2163c89b1e5597f651417465a832fd4.jpg"},{"name":"Tidal Humor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844910/3dad68db9f4caa17e5c193dbfc76610161d7337b.jpg"},{"name":"Glyph Reader","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844910/9dd5eecd949a429d2ecdec8df5f5ec2b021e758d.jpg"},{"name":"Greenroom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844910/e2c5e480f3278ca67f52c4d1bbf7c22a06e37fca.jpg"},{"name":"Black Glass","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/ste